&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE openQueryByEmbarque DBOProgram 
PROCEDURE openQueryByEmbarque :
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Purpose:     
  Parameters:  <none>
  Notes:       
------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
    OPEN QUERY  {&QueryName} FOR EACH {&TableName} NO-LOCK          WHERE
                {&TableName}.embarque    >= v-ini-embarque  AND
                {&TableName}.embarque    <= v-fim-embarque.
    
    RETURN "OK":U.

END PROCEDURE.

/* _UIB-CODE-BLOCK-END */
&ANALYZE-RESUME

